{"id": null, "n": "0184003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0184003", "type": "orig", "text": "此傳與三本大異對校甚難故今以宋本元本宮本對校明本別附載卷末 cf. P. 185b段"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184c0701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0184c0701", "type": "add", "text": "諸【CB】【麗-CB】，謂【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184c1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0184c1201", "type": "add", "text": "實【CB】【麗-CB】，寶【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0185a1601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0185a1601", "type": "add", "text": "足【CB】【麗-CB】，是【大】"}
